message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
  Authors are listed by the number of lines they committed, then by the
  number of their commits (see "Citation metadata" in the contributing guide
  of elixir-cloud-aai).
title: Krini
abstract: >-
  Krini is a virtual research environment for running and managing life
  science analyses: users who log in with an OpenID Connect provider find
  compute services in a Cloud Registry, run tasks on GA4GH
  Task Execution Service (TES) and workflows on GA4GH Workflow Execution
  Service (WES) instances, and follow their runs.
